<div class="bhd-page__keypoints" aria-label="Ambassador principles">
  <div><strong>Real fit</strong><span>Partnerships should connect to the athlete, audience and actual hydration context rather than force generic endorsements.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Clear disclosure</strong><span>Sponsored, gifted and affiliate relationships should be identified transparently wherever they appear.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Evidence first</strong><span>Ambassadors can describe their experience, but individual experience is not clinical or performance proof.</span></div>
</div>

