  <div class="bhd-page__split-copy">
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Featured athlete</p>
    <h2>Dianna Proctor</h2>
    <p>Edmonton sprinter Dianna Proctor competes in the 400 metres and relay events. In 2026 she represented Canada at the World Athletics Relays and was part of the Canadian-record mixed 4×400 metre squad. She also won the women's 300 metres at the 2026 U SPORTS Championships with the University of Guelph.</p>
    <p>Her profile is a useful example of what an athlete partnership can be: a real high-performance setting, a clear connection to hydration, and claims that remain separate from the athlete's personal results.</p>
